---
layout: layouts/base.njk
home: true
permalink: /index.html
---
<section class="title-page">
  <p class="kicker">A personal library · established 2026</p>
  <h1 class="display">The Lorenz <em>Library</em></h1>
  <p class="display-sub">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
</section>

<section class="prose foreword" aria-label="Foreword">
  <p>
    This is a library rather than a blog: a small collection of entries,
    shelved by subject, cross-referenced, and corrected in place. Nothing here
    is finished and some of it is wrong. Every entry says how far along it is,
    from <a href="/notes/epistemic-status/">manuscript to bound</a>, and how
    much I currently believe it.
  </p>
  <p>
    Start anywhere. The contents below are arranged by shelf, the
    <a href="/notes/">catalogue</a> by date, and the <a href="/tags/">subjects</a>
    alphabetically; the <a href="/map/">map</a> shows what cites what. Or press
    <kbd>/</kbd> to search.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="contents" aria-labelledby="contents-title">
  <h2 class="section-head" id="contents-title">Contents</h2>
  {% for part in collections.parts %}
  <h3 class="part"><span class="part__num">{{ part.numeral }}</span>{{ part.name }}</h3>
  <ol class="toc">
    {% for note in part.notes %}
    {%- set acc = collections.accession | lookup(note.url) -%}
    {%- set st = site.stages[note.data.stage] or site.stages.manuscript -%}
    <li class="toc__item">
      <a class="toc__link" href="{{ note.url }}">
        <span class="toc__no">{{ acc.number }}</span>
        <span class="toc__line"><span class="toc__title">{{ note.data.title }}</span><span class="toc__leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="toc__stage" title="{{ st.blurb }}"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ st.glyph }}</span> {{ st.label }}</span></span>
      </a>
      {% if note.data.summary %}<p class="toc__dek">{{ note.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
